4. CALCULATE ACTUAL DAYS TO FILL

For every valid historical record calculate:

Actual Days to Fill =
Actual Joining Date - JR Modified Date

Also calculate:

Actual Joining Year-Month =
TEXT(Actual Joining Date,“yyyymm”)

This represents the actual month in which the candidate joined.

