1. Choose the Proposed Days with the lowest Mean Absolute Error between Estimated Joining Date and Actual Joining Date.
2. If still tied, choose the Proposed Days with the lowest Median Absolute Error.
3. If still tied, choose the value closest to the historical median Actual Days to Fill.

Do not arbitrarily select a value.

